{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block main %}
<h1>Who runs this</h1>
<section aria-labelledby="operator-h">
  <h2 id="operator-h">The operator</h2>
  <p>This site is run by <a data-ext="operator" href="{{ site.operator_url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ site.operator }}</a>, a small software company. It is independent. It is not an official government site, and it is not run by, paid by or approved by the county, the city or any official, candidate, party or campaign.</p>
  <p>Every record page is an unofficial copy of public records and links the official record. <a href="{{ root }}our-rules.html">Our rules</a> say how coverage is decided and what no one can buy. <a href="{{ root }}method.html">Method</a> says how the records are collected and checked.</p>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="funding-h">
  <h2 id="funding-h">How this site is funded</h2>
  <p>The site is free to read. There are no advertisements.{% if site.support_url %} It is supported by tips through <a data-ext="support" href="{{ site.support_url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ site.support_label }}</a>.{% endif %}</p>
  <p><strong>No payers yet.</strong> No person, company, office or group pays for this site or for what it covers. If one ever does, this page will list the payer's name, the amount and the contract, as <a href="{{ root }}our-rules.html">our rules</a> require.</p>
</section>
{% endblock %}
